cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Xreading Progress Meter"
abstract: >-
  A privacy-first tool that turns an Xreading class export into a static,
  student-facing reading-progress page: a personal grade calculator plus an
  aggregate class progress ladder. All student data is processed locally;
  the published page holds only class-level counts.
authors:
